ent-Scp173Blind = Blind
  .desc =
    Blinds all entities in your line of sight for 7 seconds.
    Has a 7 second activation delay.
    Does not work outside the containment chamber. Requires more than three simultaneous watchers.
ent-Scp173Clog = Clog Tile
  .desc =
    Pollutes a tile with a special reagent.
    When the contamination bar fills, the containment chamber's hermetic hatch opens.
    Requires no watchers.
ent-Scp173DamageStructure = Desecrate
  .desc =
    Deals minor damage to all structures in the immediate vicinity.
    Does not work in the containment chamber. Requires no watchers.
ent-Scp173FastMovement = Jump
  .desc =
    Fast movement in a small radius. Targets struck by it die.
    Does not work in the containment chamber, requires no more than two watchers.
